; The one variable: `layout_direction = 3` (RTL) on the lower CheckBox. It draws the check glyph at
; the right content margin (check_box.cpp:127-131) and moves Button's margin across (:98-100).
; Both rows are pressed, so a swap reads at a glance. No other scene draws an RTL CheckBox.

